{
  "description": "The proposal involves a rear extension comprising a 6-metre deep extension at ground floor level and a 3-metre deep extension at first floor level. These works have been designed following the guidance provided in the pre-application advice. The development is intended to increase the internal living space for the existing single-family home, while maintaining the overall character of the property and adhering to local planning guidelines. The extension will match the adjoining property in scale, height, and design, replicating the neighbouring property's roof form, materials, and external finishes to ensure visual continuity and preserve the symmetry of the semi-detached dwellings.",
